@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_OR_SUPER_ADMIN_JWT

### List/filter transport routes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/routes?originId=1&destinationId=2&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create an active transport route
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originId": 1,
  "destinationId": 2,
  "estimatedDurationMinutes": 120
}

### Replace route details or lifecycle status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/routes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originId": 1,
  "destinationId": 2,
  "estimatedDurationMinutes": 150,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
